{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-post-template-tsx","path":"/posts/jwplayer/events_cast_controls_floating/","result":{"data":{"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"html":"<h2 id=\"cast-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Cast Events<a href=\"#cast-events\" aria-label=\"cast events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>이 API 호출은 개발자가 <strong>캐스트 관련 이벤트를 감지</strong>할 수 있도록 합니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"oncast\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘cast’)<a href=\"#oncast\" aria-label=\"oncast permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>캐스트 속성이 변경될 때 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"available\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"active\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"deviceName\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"ViewerTV\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"cast\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>active</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>캐스팅이 시작되었는지(<code class=\"language-text\">true</code>) 또는 중지되었는지(<code class=\"language-text\">false</code>)를 나타냅니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>available</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>캐스트 가능한 디바이스가 존재하면 <code class=\"language-text\">true</code>, 없으면 <code class=\"language-text\">false</code>를 반환합니다.</li>\n<li>캐스트 가능한 기기가 탐지되면 <strong>플레이어 컨트롤 바에 캐스트 아이콘이 표시됩니다.</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>deviceName</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>시청자가 기기에 지정한 이름(수신기 이름)을 나타냅니다.</li>\n<li>이 속성은 <code class=\"language-text\">\"cast.active\": \"true\"</code>일 때만 채워집니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어 이벤트의 카테고리 (이 이벤트의 경우 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"cast\"</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"oncastintercepted\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘castIntercepted’)<a href=\"#oncastintercepted\" aria-label=\"oncastintercepted permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.jwplayer.com/players/reference/casting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><code class=\"language-text\">interceptCast</code></a>가 활성화된 상태에서 사용자가 콘텐츠를 캐스트하려고 시도할 때 발생합니다.</p>\n<p>이 이벤트는 또한 <strong>현재 캐스트 세션이 활성 상태인지 여부</strong>를 나타냅니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"js\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-js line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-js\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token string-property property\">\"isCasting\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">false</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token string-property property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"castIntercepted\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>isCasting</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Chromecast 기기가 미디어를 캐스트 중(<code class=\"language-text\">true</code>)인지, 아닌지(<code class=\"language-text\">false</code>)를 나타냅니다.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>수신 중인 이벤트의 유형을 식별합니다. (이 이벤트의 경우 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"castIntercepted\"</code>)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"control-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Control Events<a href=\"#control-events\" aria-label=\"control events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>이 API 호출은 개발자가 **내장 플레이어 컨트롤(컨트롤 바 및 디스플레이 아이콘)**과 상호작용할 수 있도록 합니다.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>재생 중 비디오가 키보드나 마우스 포커스를 잃으면 <strong>컨트롤은 자동으로 사라집니다.</strong><br>\n컨트롤이 비활성화되면 JW Player는 완전히 <strong>크롬 없는(chrome-less)</strong> 상태가 됩니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"oncontrols\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘controls’)<a href=\"#oncontrols\" aria-label=\"oncontrols permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>스크립트에 의해 <strong>컨트롤이 활성화되거나 비활성화될 때</strong> 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<p>다음과 같은 객체를 반환합니다:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>controls</strong> (boolean)\n<ul>\n<li>컨트롤의 새로운 상태를 나타냅니다. (<code class=\"language-text\">true</code> = 활성화, <code class=\"language-text\">false</code> = 비활성화)</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"ondisplayclick\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘displayClick’)<a href=\"#ondisplayclick\" aria-label=\"ondisplayclick permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>사용자가 <strong>비디오 디스플레이 영역을 클릭할 때</strong> 트리거됩니다.<br>\n이 이벤트는 <strong>내장 컨트롤이 비활성화된 경우, 사용자 정의 컨트롤을 연결할 때</strong> 특히 유용합니다.</p>\n<blockquote class=\"prompt-tip\">\n<p>컨트롤이 활성화되어 있으면 기본 클릭 동작(재생/일시정지 토글)은 여전히 발생합니다.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"displayClick\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>type</strong> (string)\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어 이벤트의 카테고리</li>\n<li>이 이벤트의 경우 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"displayClick\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"floating-player-events\" style=\"position:relative;\">Floating Player Events<a href=\"#floating-player-events\" aria-label=\"floating player events permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h2>\n<p>플레이어는 사용자가 <strong>플로팅 상태를 동적으로 업데이트</strong>할 수 있도록 합니다.</p>\n<h3 id=\"onfloat\" style=\"position:relative;\">.on(‘float’)<a href=\"#onfloat\" aria-label=\"onfloat permalink\" class=\"anchor custom-class after\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"16\" version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M4 9h1v1H4c-1.5 0-3-1.69-3-3.5S2.55 3 4 3h4c1.45 0 3 1.69 3 3.5 0 1.41-.91 2.72-2 3.25V8.59c.58-.45 1-1.27 1-2.09C10 5.22 8.98 4 8 4H4c-.98 0-2 1.22-2 2.5S3 9 4 9zm9-3h-1v1h1c1 0 2 1.22 2 2.5S13.98 12 13 12H9c-.98 0-2-1.22-2-2.5 0-.83.42-1.64 1-2.09V6.25c-1.09.53-2 1.84-2 3.25C6 11.31 7.55 13 9 13h4c1.45 0 3-1.69 3-3.5S14.5 6 13 6z\"></path></svg></a></h3>\n<p>플로팅 플레이어가 <strong>떠오르거나(floating 시작) 원래 위치로 복귀할 때</strong> 트리거됩니다.</p>\n<div class=\"gatsby-highlight\" data-language=\"json\"><pre style=\"counter-reset: linenumber NaN\" class=\"language-json line-numbers\"><code class=\"language-json\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"floating\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token boolean\">true</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\r\n  <span class=\"token property\">\"type\"</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"float\"</span>\r\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"line-numbers-rows\" style=\"white-space: normal; width: auto; left: 0;\"><span></span><span></span><span></span><span></span></span></pre></div>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>floating</strong> (boolean)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어의 플로팅 상태를 나타냅니다.</li>\n<li>가능한 값:\n<ul>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">true</code>: 플로팅 플레이어 상태</li>\n<li><code class=\"language-text\">false</code>: 플레이어가 원래 위치로 복귀된 상태</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>type</strong> (string)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>플레이어 이벤트의 카테고리</li>\n<li>이 이벤트의 경우 항상 <code class=\"language-text\">\"float\"</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","tableOfContents":"<ul>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#cast-events\">Cast Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#oncast\">.on(‘cast’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#oncastintercepted\">.on(‘castIntercepted’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#control-events\">Control Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#oncontrols\">.on(‘controls’)</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#ondisplayclick\">.on(‘displayClick’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><a href=\"#floating-player-events\">Floating Player Events</a></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"#onfloat\">.on(‘float’)</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>","fields":{"gitLastModified":"Oct 7, 2026"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Events - Cast, Controls, Floating","summary":"Cast Events 이 API 호출은 개발자가 캐스트 관련 이벤트를 감지할 수 있도록 합니다. .on(\"cast\") 캐스트 속성이 변경될 때 트리거됩니다. - active (boolean) - 캐스팅이 시작되었는지(true) 또는 중지되었는지(false)를 나타냅니다. - available (boolean)","date":"Mar 14, 2025","categories":["JWPlayer"],"tags":[""],"author":["aluvy"],"thumbnail":null}}}]}},"pageContext":{"slug":"/posts/jwplayer/events_cast_controls_floating/","prev":{"slug":"/posts/jwplayer/events_buffer_captions/","title":"Events - Buffer, Captions"},"next":{"slug":"/posts/jwplayer/events_metadata/","title":"Events - Metadata"}}},"staticQueryHashes":["1397594759","2043619371"],"slicesMap":{}}